# The tech arm on the champion: arty + raid + one land factory unlocked
# through the ability verb, heavyTank joining the mix when the tier opens.
# The unlock saves toward itself (a refused claim withholds its price), so
# the cost is 2,000 credits plus the saving pause it forces; the first
# unlock already opens production, which is why the count is one
# ([[policy-budget]], [[mechanics-build-actions]]).

name techroster
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies heavyTank,heavyHoverTank,heavyArtillery
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 3
rush 0
creep 0
hold 0
riposte 0
kite 0
tech 1
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 0
medics 0
navy 0
battery 0
decoys 0
hp_floor 0
bunkers 0
flame 0
close 0
income_ladder 0
guns 0
nukes 0
rebuild 0
